# Sticky, Readable Grid Tables

For wide matrix/grid tables (e.g. inventory color x size) inside a `<x-ui.page-card>`:

## Scroll container

- The scroll element owns BOTH axes: `max-h-[...] overflow-auto`.
- Do NOT put padding on the scroll element — top padding leaves a gap where rows peek ABOVE a `top-0` sticky header. Pad placeholder/empty `<p>` messages instead.

## Sticky cells (z-index layering)

- Header cells: `sticky top-0 z-20` + opaque `bg-gray-50` + `border-b`.
- First column cells: `sticky left-0 z-10` + opaque `bg-white` + `border-r`.
- Top-left corner cell: `sticky left-0 top-0 z-30` so it stays above both.

## Readable header

- Override only the grid's own selector (not `.ui-table th`): `text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-600`.
- Keep horizontal row dividers only; avoid vertical per-cell borders.
